    "identifier": "breath-of-earth-bipolar",
    "description": "<p>You begin to collect earth release chakra until it laces the striking portion of your weapon, magnifying its weight. You spin with such power that anything standing in your way becomes a memory.</p>\n<p>Make a single melee taijutsu attack, comparing the result against creatures in your weapons range AC. On a hit, you deal your weapons damage + 2d6 earth damage.</p>\n<p>Chain 1: If your attack result is 5 or higher than the targets AC, you Pierce 4 DR.</p>\n<p>Chain 2: The affected creatures must make a Constitution saving throw, becoming Bruised on a failed save.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d6. If this jutsu is cast at A-Rank, this attack is so fierce you gain +4 DR until the beginning of your next turn.</p>",
